    "scenario": "BGP DMZ Link Bandwidth",
    "goals": "\u2022 Configure IBGP within AS {{as1}}. Use the loopback0 interfaces to source the BGP updates from.\n  AS {{as1}}: {{router1_name}}, {{router2_name}}, {{router4_name}}\n\u2022 Configure IBGP within AS {{as2}}. Use the loopback0 interfaces to source the BGP updates from.\n  AS {{as2}}: {{router3_name}}, {{router5_name}}\n\u2022 Configure EBGP between AS {{as1}} and AS {{as2}}.\n\u2022 Ensure traffic from router {{router1_name}} to AS {{as2}} network {{link5_network}}/{{link5_prefix_len}} is load balanced proportionally over all available links.",
